 "solution": "\\((-1)^{2}=1\\)；\\(2\\sin45^\\circ=2\\times\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}=\\sqrt2\\)，因为 \\(1-\\sqrt2<0\\)，所以 \\(\\left|1-\\sqrt2\\right|=\\sqrt2-1\\)；\\(\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)^{-2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\left(-\\frac12\\right)^{2}}=4\\)。\n原式 \\(=1+(\\sqrt2-1)-\\sqrt2-1+4=3\\)。",
