    "body": "\\((-1)^{2}=1\\)；\\(2\\sin45^\\circ=2\\times\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}=\\sqrt2\\)，因为 \\(1-\\sqrt2<0\\)，所以 \\(\\left|1-\\sqrt2\\right|=\\sqrt2-1\\)；\\(\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)^{-2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\left(-\\frac12\\right)^{2}}=4\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "合并",
    "body": "原式 \\(=1+(\\sqrt2-1)-\\sqrt2-1+4=3\\)。"
   }
  ],
  "check": "用近似值：\\(1+0.414-2.414+4=3\\)，一致。",
  "pitfalls": [
